# Copy to .env.local. The address of the Varlet API (see ../Varlet-fashion/backend/README.md).
# Keep 127.0.0.1 for local development on every platform: src/services/http.ts
# switches it to your computer's network address on phones and emulators.
# Use the https address once the API is deployed.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8100
